    "Generate a gorgeous premium text-free photographic editorial background, vertical 9:16 Instagram Story, final composition 1080x1920. Topic: a cryptocurrency exchange security incident, digital assets frozen during a suspected hack. A restrained architectural digital vault, polished black graphite and subtle Binance-yellow/amber lighting, deep almost-black charcoal with brushed titanium detail. NO logo, no charts, no screens with numbers, no characters or writing, no hackers or people. Upper 80 percent left 85 percent is a broad quiet very dark matte graphite vault-wall surface for extremely readable large white/yellow typesetting; its texture is very subtle. Specifically x104\u2013850 y164\u20131510 must remain even, dark, plain and unobstructed. At far right x885\u20131080 from y650 downward, a structural vault-door column runs vertically, front-facing charcoal brushed metal, with gold edging and tiny engineering grooves. At x949,y1090 on this right column reserve a perfectly round EMPTY inset brass-rimmed medallion mounting recess of diameter190px, seen perfectly front-on; realistic dark contact shadow, metallic edge, subtle amber light. The user's exact original Moneyberg coin will be composited into this recess later, so DO NOT generate any coin artwork, face, letters, medallion decoration, or substitute emblem. The whole eventual coin must be above y1440. The bottom quarter y1550\u20131920 features the physical thick beveled edge of a monumental closed security vault, elegant interlocking metallic locking bars and subtle amber light reflected on dark metal floor, evocative of securing digital assets. Materially rich and realistic, not a cartoon padlock or cyberpunk neon. Avoid floating panels and distracting objects. No glass cracks or damage, no suggestion of a confirmed theft. Final authored text later uses actual Lato Black900 for headline>=51px, labels>=33px and small single-line35px MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF; Georgia for body>=35px and sources>=33px. Every